	(text "SDRAM 128 MB (positions for 256 MB) and boot flash" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ff92d16f-5744-5863-aa91-1c1cee530120"))
	(text "Two Winbond W989D6DB (512 Mbit, 16 bits wide, 1.8 V low-power type) form one 32-bit bank of 128 MB on SEMC_CS0:" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 21.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "540d7a99-3f78-543e-bd64-95e906f26b63"))
	(text "    U3 carries D0-D15, U4 carries D16-D31. The brain pads are the ones NXP's board uses (data/sdram.csv); the chips are" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b818f7ab-a5d7-5c0a-bf35-d59baba3cecb"))
	(text "    not: NXP fits 3.3 V W9825G6KH. Both memory pad banks (NVCC_EMC1, NVCC_EMC2) therefore run at 1.8 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 29.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a2c52b95-081d-54f6-9e72-3611697cb562"))
	(text "U8/U9 are the same again on SEMC_CSX0 (ball L1) for 256 MB: NOT FITTED on the first build. On B silicon only CSX0 or" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 33.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "da3c010f-3d53-5f07-8e15-43afbe7f8fcf"))
	(text "    RDY may be a second SDRAM select (erratum ERR052401). No NXP board has two banks: this wiring is inferred." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 38.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a8957601-13cb-5c34-af5d-493ebdfbaac1"))
	(text "NOT PROVEN: this chip type asks for an extended mode register write at start-up (BA1 high); NXP's driver does not send" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 42.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64482316-a0fa-5974-b89f-93c8a377ef02"))
	(text "    one and no report of this chip family on this controller was found. The data sheet gives full drive, all banks" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 46.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d57b8921-7427-5924-bc31-0c4defa2b104"))
	(text "    refreshed as the reset state on one page and \"undefined\" on another. To be tried on the evaluation board first." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 50.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9dcbc1a9-c9dd-5171-8583-a4b9111a96ff"))
	(text "Timing: 166 MHz at CAS latency 3 at most (NXP's own settings run their faster chips at 198 MHz)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 54.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ae166e78-4fac-5ea9-940f-81de551e4c84"))
	(text "SEMC_DQS (ball J2) must stay unconnected: the chip loops its own clock back through that pad." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 59.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "55e2307c-f533-51df-8113-f11e623b9517"))
	(text "Flash: FlexSPI1 port A on GPIO_SD_B2_06..11 (boot.md). FLEXSPI1_A_DQS (ball E14) must stay unconnected for 133 MHz." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 63.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9766053d-42b9-5e0a-a980-f0972425753d"))
	(text "Pin numbers of both memories were compared with Winbond's data sheets (W989D6DB A01-002 p.5, W25Q128JW rev G p.6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 67.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9a2fb995-c48f-5dd2-99db-351fe8747c2b"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
